Sun Dec  3 16:05:25 2000  Martin Reddy  <reddy@Lomond.AI.SRI.COM>

	* DotGeo.c (tvBaseDotGeoThread): previously, a dataset was loaded
 	from .geo only if there was an OI and DEM with a matching name in
 	the returned response. Now, if there is no matching name, we try
 	to match based on whether any DEMs cover this OI in the returned
 	response, or whether any already-loaded DEMs cover the OI. The DEM
 	with an area closest matching the OI is chosen in the case of
 	multiple matches.

