Sat Feb 27 16:49:23 1999  Martin Reddy  <reddy@Lomond.AI.SRI.COM>

	* TsLogging.c (TVLoggerLogData): [removed] - obsolete call to log
	internal TerraVision events to a file

	* Texture.c (TextureCacheBindSlow): removed call to obsolete
	TVLoggerLogData call for texture logging.

	* AboutDialog.c (CreateAboutDialog): only display the SPROC-PTHR
 	module in the About dialog if the binary is compiled on an
 	SGI. The NuTCracker environment does not have an explicit pthread
 	library - it is all included in libc. This would previously make
 	TerraVision report that the PC version was compiled with the SGI
 	sproc pthread emulation library.

	* ThreeDWidget1.c (FillClipEquations): changed the ifdef check
	from "sgi" to "__sgi". The former is only defined if compiled with
	the (default) -cckr option, but not under -ansi. The latter
	(__sgi) is defined under both compilation modes and so is the more
	robust check.

	* TerraVision.c (TerraVisionSpawnProcs): ditto on the __sgi thing

	* TerraVisionInc.h: ditto on the __sgi thing

