	resource to True. Then we can set the XmNinitialFocus of the 3-D
	window to the windowArea widget, which stops the Dismiss widget
	from getting the initial keyboard focus. All this means that we
	can now detect keypresses in the main 3-D viewer window!! Geez
	that was easy!!!
	(ThreeDWidgetKeypress): [new func] catches all keypress events for
	the 3-D viewer. Currently we support: esc (close window), M/m
