	* Texture.c (TextureTune): Comment out stopgap expansion of
	  texture cache size.  Maybe no longer needed.
	(TextureCacheRemoveCB): Replace lru_hash with eqhash.
	(TextureCacheCreate): Remove TsGeoPyramid* argument, since a cache
	  is now simply a cache for an OpenGL context and may contain
	  tiles from multiple pyramids.  Initialize new refcount and
	  unused table fields.
	(TextureCacheHandleDelete): New. Delete a handle from cache,
	  freeing tex_id and logging deletion.
	(TextureCacheHandleCreate): New. Create a TextureCacheHandle to be
	  included in the cache.  Grab least recent unused handle if any
	  unused, otherwise create a new one.
	(TextureCacheHandleResurrect): New. Take a handle found in the
	  unused list, and re-enter it in the usable category.
	(TextureCacheFind): Moved from TextureInline.h.  Finds a handle
	  given (geo,tile) pair.  Creates a new one if necessary.
	(TextureCacheCountUnused): New.  Return number of unused tiles in
	  TextureCache.
	(TextureCacheHandleFree): New. If we have room, move the tile
	  onto the unused list, otherwise, delete it.  Called when
	  reference count goes to zero.
	(TextureCacheHandleRelease): New. Decrement reference count for a
	  handle and free if necessary.
	(TextureTraceShow): New. Dump a backtrace element for a given
	  TextureCache.
	(TextureCacheDump): New. Dump a description of the state of the
	  cache, including backtrace if TEXTRACE_==1.
	(TextureCacheReset): Clear the cache.
	(TextureCacheBindSlow): Now only takes handle argument (assumes
	  mapping between handle and tile already done).
	(TextureCacheReleaseVisibleList): New. Decrements reference
	  counts for TextureCacheHandle*'s in the visibleList.
	(TextureCachePrepareVisibleList): Renamed from
	  TextureCacheShuffleVisibleList().  Prepares a visibileList
	  for rendering by translating tiles to TextureCacheHandle*'s.
	  Also updates reference counts for handles.
	* Texture.h (TextureCacheCreate): Remove TsGeoPyramid* argument.
	(TextureCachePrepareVisibleList): New declaration.
	(TextureCacheReleaseVisibleList): New declaration.  
	(TextureCacheDump): New declaration.
	* TextureInline.h (TEXTRACE_): New macro.  Trigger for texture
	  cache tracing managament.  If 1, enables backtrace of texture
	  handling calls.
	(struct TextureTrace): New. Holds texture cache backtrace entry.
	(struct TextureTraceList): New. Holds texture cache backtrace.
	(TEXTRACE): New macro.  Calls TextureTraceAdd() when TEXTRACE_==1,
	  otherwise expands to nothing.
	(struct TextureCache): Moved from Texture.h and restructured for
	  reference counting and auxiliary LRU circular list.  Optionally
	  includes the TextureTraceList for this cache.
	(TextureCacheLock): New macro.  Locks the cache.
	(TextureCacheUnlock): New macro.  Unlocks the cache.
	(TextureTraceAdd): New.  Add a backtrace entry to the cache's
	  list.
	(TextureCacheHandleId): New.  Extract texture ID from a handle.
	(TextureCacheBind): Take only a handle argument.  Now requires
	  that TextureCachePrepareVisibleList() be called before
	  attempting to bind any textures.
