Fri Jan 17 11:02:44 1997  Lee Iverson  <leei@Canada.AI.SRI.COM>

	* The beginning of recorded history.  OpenGL port.

	* TwoDWidget.h (CallbackDescr, TwoDWidget): Add facility for
	  deferring actions into the rendering thread (locked struct
	  element pendingCallbacks).

	* TwoDWidget.c (TwoDWidgetRegisterCallback): Add a callback to the
	  list of deferred callbacks.

	* TwoDWidget.c (TwoDWidgetProcessCallbacks): Process all deferred
	  callbacks in the order of deferral.

	* TwoDWidget.c (TwoDWidgetRegisterInitCB,
	  TwoDWidgetRegisterResizeCB): Two callbacks which defer their
	  processing.

	* TwoDWidget.c (CreateTwoDWidget): Register the deferred callbacks
	  for InitCB and ResizeCB.

	* TwoDWidget.c (TwoDWidgetDraw): Process all deferred callbacks in
	  the rendering thread.  This way we should be able to minimize
	  OpenGL context switches.


